sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Player
    participant W as Website
    participant API as Claim workflow
    participant C as Character state
    P->>W: Sign in after character discovery
    W->>API: Query this user's pending claims
    API-->>W: Pending characters with realm, source and sync time
    W-->>P: Review before continuing to raid planning
    alt Player rejects a claim
        P->>W: Reject character
        W->>API: Record rejected claim
        API-->>W: Exclude character from player's signup choices
    else Player approves a claim
        P->>W: Approve character
        W->>API: Submit claim approval
        API->>C: Check current owner and claim evidence
        alt Another identity owns the character
            C-->>API: Ownership conflict
            API-->>W: Keep claim unresolved without transferring ownership
        else Claim can be approved
            API->>C: Record owner and approved claim together
            API-->>W: Character becomes selectable
        end
    end
